WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.380
Hi, I'm Dr. John Peterson
at River Crossing Dental,

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.660
and I'm excited to share
with you something new.

3
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.300
Her name's Eve,

4
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.800
and she's our new AI receptionist,

5
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.100
which means that you can call anytime,

6
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.980
even nights and weekends,
to schedule your appointment.

7
00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:17.160
I've tested her myself,

8
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.280
and she works great
at scheduling appointments

9
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.720
and answering dental-related questions.

10
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.180
So give her a try. Give her a call.

11
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.260
Your appointment will be scheduled

12
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.300
during our regular office hours,
Monday through Thursday.

